        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;">Docket No. AI93-5-001 issued on April 23, 1993 (Accounting for Income Taxes).</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
