      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;">ASC 980-710-25 "Accounting for the Effects of Certain Types of Regulation" contains discussion of the regulatory accounting implications of recording accrued vacation under ASC 710-10-25.</span>
